{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>And it struck.</b> This was a severe plague, for it killed man and beast, and shattered the tree of the field — only that HaShem had compassion on them and on their livestock. And Moses did not mention this to Pharaoh, for he saw that Pharaoh sent and not one of Israel's livestock died, and he did not set his heart to it."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:32:59.234109668Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}